{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/7","id":4906188356,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUZxf888AAAABJG5-RA","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/7","diff_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/7.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pull/7.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/issues/7","number":7,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(0.1.10): 整合更新详情、Windows数据根与图形资源修复","user":{"login":"gzers","id":22311504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"概览和设置的更新详情切换曾丢失焦点，Windows 安装根恢复及自定义数据根卸载链路也存在缺口。本 PR 汇总固定产品源码 8e69ff6d 的修复，供 0.1.10 最终集成审阅：\n\n- 更新详情按精确版本核验来源，提供有界说明缓存、独立重试与网页出口；查询完成先持久化，再共享结果，保留弹窗焦点。\n- Windows 不可写安装根提供恢复选择并持久绑定；空目录可显式初始化。NSIS 明确清理取得实例和备份锁，只处理核验过的自有根，外置 HOME 保留；默认卸载保留数据。\n- Windows 透明应用图标、浅深托盘图标与安装向导阶段/路径反馈一并整合。\n- WebGL 创建前确定画布尺寸，释放探测及销毁上下文，避免将主动销毁识别为设备故障。\n\n验证：固定 8e 的[完整 CI](https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/actions/runs/39032153138)通过，macOS 938 / Windows 667 项，前端 100 文件 / 542 项；[唯一 Windows 候选](https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/actions/runs/39033532953)及本机已核销证据沿原范围复用。Mac 8e arm64 app/DMG 构建成功，原生两次正常退出均 exit0；备份/固定/深色偏好跨重启、更新中心键盘焦点和真实说明内滚动已补。源码未因本轮 Mac 验证改变。\n\nMac 证据和剩余边界已提交至 docs/governance-main@9af58e6b，入口为 [IMP-20](https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/blob/docs/governance-main/docs/03-开发实施/IMP-OPENCODEX-DESKTOP-20.md)。CPU/RSS 按用户接受处理，DPI 专项取消；未重复资源采样或扩建采集工具。\n\n当前为草稿。真实更新应用/重启版本回读、相关事件隔离、部分备份/原生组合及正式分发签名仍需按原清单处理；Mac 候选使用 --no-sign，严格签名校验失败已保留。旧 CI 失败和原始样本继续保留，不由新成功推定根因。TASK-182 的八检查未整体核销，最终发布确认尚待，不自动合并、签名、晋升或公开发布。\n","created_at":"2026-10-18T03:54:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:54:12Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"48cff7dd7079e6872e804709cd1da6c87ab1e126","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/7/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/7/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/issues/7/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/statuses/8e69ff6db69ea13b8cb29feb9f7a1abacd202a7b","head":{"label":"gzers:feature/0.1.10-windows-uninstall-data","ref":"feature/0.1.10-windows-uninstall-data","sha":"8e69ff6db69ea13b8cb29feb9f7a1abacd202a7b","user":{"login":"gzers","id":22311504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/orgs","